{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore and Fight</h2>Explore an interconnected system of abandoned structures with your robot <strong>companion</strong>. Engage in intense combat within confined spaces to gather essential nutrients and restore <strong>life</strong> to a dying ecosystem.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117010/extras/9ccf7126f20b5699e0df88abfcfbe69c.webp?t=1774966099\" width=780 height=8 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117010/extras/f9b2fa35d98bff2a75745adf597870b0.poster.avif?t=1774966099\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117010/extras/f9b2fa35d98bff2a75745adf597870b0.webm?t=1774966099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117010/extras/f9b2fa35d98bff2a75745adf597870b0.mp4?t=1774966099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve Puzzles</h2>Restoring this world takes more than strength. Solve <strong>puzzles</strong> that defy logic and <strong>blur the lines with reality</strong>. The solution is rarely where you expect it to be.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117010/extras/9ccf7126f20b5699e0df88abfcfbe69c.webp?t=1774966099\" width=780 height=8 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117010/extras/d291296450672ae403985b16aff2936c.poster.avif?t=1774966099\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117010/extras/d291296450672ae403985b16aff2936c.webm